\n➊Survival Mechanics: Manage your hunger, warmth, and water to stay alive.\n\n➊Resource Gathering: Scavenge the wreckage and the environment for vital supplies.\n\n➊Shelter Building: Construct shelters to protect yourself from the elements.\n\n➊Wildlife Encounters: Beware of polar bears and other wildlife as you explore.\n\n➊Teamwork: Collaborate with other players to increase your chances of survival.\n\nPrepare for an intense and thrilling survival adventure in \"Survive Flight 871\"!\n\nPlease share plane crash\n\n\n","path":"/game/16884010485-survive-flight-871","slug":"16884010485-survive-flight-871","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/193b67ff90001af503ce71b7e4f1dfd9bd692c2d1786bc82a41a0be7b20ba763.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b998c1c02810797888078276ea94b031/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":26,"visitor":73969233,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-07-30T16:07:24.652Z","creator":{"name":"Lillmannen_real","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}}],"totalGames":14215,"totalPages":593,"currentPage":235}